  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Ethiopia&#x2019;s Migration Data Collection and Management Capacity Through the Installation of the Migration Information and Data Analysis System (MIDAS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen Ethiopia&#x2019;s border governance capacity through the improvement of its border management information system infrastructure. To achieve this objective, IOM will provide assistance to the Immigration and Citizenship Service (ICS) through the installation of the Migration Information and Data Analysis System (MIDAS), the provision of related equipment and specialized training to Immigration Officers to effectively use the system to collect, manage and analyze migration data.</narrative>
  </description>
